      "id": "claim_bdc4d64eb0d04419ac1e99180277843a",
      "statement": "MoSynth is a Unity 6000.4.4 project that synthesizes character locomotion, structured as a synthesis-agnostic substrate in the AnimationTools assembly plus two interchangeable synthesis methods — search over an animation database, and a neural motion field evaluated in Python — that both plug into it through the MoSynthStage seam.",
